        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "35-11-2 Teachers will be granted leaves of absence with-out pay for one (1) full academic year, provided that the purpose of such leave does not include another paid teaching position. This provision shall not prohibit a teacher from accepting a fellowship which may result in a simultaneous paid teaching position, and it shall not prohibit exchange teaching.",
